== filter escape 
-- todo checklist
-- h2: ssg9000
-- prelude: Things to set up for my 
static site generator. 

[] Updated the error report so the 
data is stored in memory instead of in
a file. 

[] Set up so that errors don't include
the entire sites worth of data and become
giant and potentially eat up all the space
on the drive. 

[] Migrated admin templates out
of the binary into an ``admin`` folder
next to the ``content`` folder.

[] Automatically generating OG images
for posts. They're filenames are "og-image-auto.jpg".
They can be overridden by placing a file
in the same directory named "og-image.jpg".

[] Created CRUD tool for blog 
entires on the admin page. 

[] Added VIM motions to the
blog post editor. 

[] Set up to capture alt text
from images automatically. 

[] Created a CRUD tool for quotes
on the admin page. 

[] Created a CRUD tool for journal 
entries on the admin page. 

[] Created an extension and interface
to collect and edit bookmarks.

[] CSS is validated with (https://github.com/w3c/css-validator)

[] CSS is tree-shaken

[] MIGHT_BE_DONE: 
Deprecated ``highlight`` and replaced
it with with ``highlight(CODE [OPTIONS])`` 
so keyword args can be passed in
for title, headings, etc.

[] Split out the admin page/interface
so it's on its own server/port.

[x] Added `image` function that takes
the stem of a file name and returns
an image tag with the path to the
image regardless of where it is. 
Option keywords arguments can 
be passes as well. The first is
`class` which overrides the default
class from the image call. 

[x] Added a ``youtube`` function that 
inserts youtube player designed to work
with the web component. 

[x] Added functions for ``footnote`` and
``footref`` for linking back and forth between footnotes. 


